        <p>This is the page for learing how view grades in a course in the Course Grade Calculator.</p>
        <br>
        <p>To view the grades for a course, follow these steps:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Click on the course you would like to see the grades for.</li>
            <img src="/images/ViewAverageAndEndGrade.png" alt="Landing Page of the Course Grade Calculator with Course Selected" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto; margin-top: 20px;">
            <li>This will show you the average and end grades for the selected course. It will also tell you the amount of grades currently in each subsection, and the weight of each section.</li>
